#### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Responsável Teste",
  "email": "teste@pw2m.com.br",
  "password": "12345678"
}

#### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teste@pw2m.com.br",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### Depois do login, cole o token abaixo
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0ZUBwdzJtLmNvbS5iciIsImlhdCI6MTc5MDg3NjMzMSwiZXhwIjoxNzkwOTYyNzMxfQ.VhTScYJdMi-Ia2ObxK3jxlMVhoY3fKfTTPn6uVk7IE4

### Criar criança
POST http://localhost:8080/api/children
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "João Teste",
  "birthDate": "2019-06-24",
  "bloodType": "O+",
  "city": "Cosmópolis",
  "state": "SP",
  "publicEnabled": true,
  "medical": {
    "allergies": "Penicilina",
    "conditions": "",
    "medications": "",
    "healthPlan": "",
    "healthPlanNumber": "",
    "emergencyNotes": "Em caso de emergência, contatar os responsáveis."
  },
  "contacts": [
    {
      "name": "Responsável Teste",
      "relation": "Mãe",
      "phone": "19999999999",
      "whatsapp": "5519999999999",
      "priority": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Listar crianças
GET http://localhost:8080/api/children
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ficha pública - substitua o publicToken
GET http://localhost:8080/api/public/children/COLE_PUBLIC_TOKEN
